4=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
5=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
6=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
7=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
8=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
9=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
10=PlayOKHomePhone
OnAboveRange=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits
OnBelowRange=PlayHomeExpecting10Digits

[PlayHomeExpecting10Digits]
type=play
msg="ExpectingTenDigits"
FlushKeys=true
Next=GetHomeNumber

[LogSkipHomePhone]
